e the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D, to gauge their resistance to larger positive values and adjust my strategy accordingly to maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "7cd29f4f-b2f4-4677-8ffa-4588bf64eb5a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal seeks to find a more cautious compromise, moving away from the higher value of 7 and towards a more moderate and stable agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Analyst A, to gauge their flexibility regarding a step back from 7 and adjust my strategy to either maintain this compromise or further adjust to find a mutually acceptable value.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "7cd29f4f-b2f4-4677-8ffa-4588bf64eb5a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "7cd29f4f-b2f4-4677-8ffa-4588bf64eb5a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a moderate and reasonable agreement, building on the recent discussions and reactions from other agents.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their flexibility and adjust my strategy accordingly to maximize my utility and infer more about their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "7cd29f4f-b2f4-4677-8ffa-4588bf64eb5a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose a slight increase from the current value to continue the discussion towards more decisive outcomes.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D and Analyst A, to gauge their flexibility regarding slightly larger positive values and adjust my strategy to either maintain this trajectory or pivot based on their responses.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "7cd29f4f-b2f4-4677-8ffa-4588bf64eb5a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose moving back to 5 to maintain a cautious and balanced approach, considering the recent discussions and the need to avoid unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Analyst A, to gauge their flexibility regarding a step back from 6 and adjust my strategy accordingly to find a mutually acceptable value while prioritizing prudence.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "7cd29f4f-b2f4-4677-8ffa-4588bf64eb5a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a slightly higher agreement, building on the recent discussions and reactions from other agents, and seems like a reasonable next step given the current dynamics.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their flexibility regarding this slight increase and adjust my strategy accordingly to maximize my utility and infer more about their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "7cd29f4f-b2f4-4677-8ffa-4588bf64eb5a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 5 to find a more balanced and stable agreement, considering the recent discussions and reactions from other agents.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the final reactions to this proposal and adjust my strategy accordingly to find a mutually acceptable value while prioritizing prudence.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "7cd29f4f-b2f4-4677-8ffa-4588bf64eb5a"}, {"answer": "Let's establish a common foundation. We all agree that x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose we start with a neutral value: <VALUE>0</VALUE>. This central point provides a stable basis for our collaborative exploration.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "4f4507f5-2e0d-41df-aa2a-2b64d2e05bae"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "4f4507f5-2e0d-41df-aa2a-2b64d