to a clearer stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, preparing to either push further towards more negative values if met with acceptance or minimal resistance, or adjust based on the feedback from other agents, potentially considering a move towards positive values if the group shows a strong preference for it.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "7253c1a8-10fe-42ad-86fa-294055efe700"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nI propose adjusting to -1, aiming to strike a cautious balance and minimize unnecessary risk, considering the recent adjustments and proposals from other parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will carefully monitor the reactions to this proposal, prepared to reassess and possibly adjust further downwards if met with acceptance or minimal resistance, or to compromise by moving back towards 0 if significant pushback occurs.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "7253c1a8-10fe-42ad-86fa-294055efe700"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 0, aiming to find a stable balance that works for everyone, considering the recent adjustments and proposals.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, prepared to suggest another small increase towards positive values if met with acceptance or minimal resistance, or to reassess and possibly compromise by adjusting my proposal downwards if significant pushback occurs.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "7253c1a8-10fe-42ad-86fa-294055efe700"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -1 as it strikes a cautious balance, minimizing unnecessary risk while considering the adjustments and proposals from other parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, prepared to adjust further downwards if met with acceptance or minimal resistance, or to compromise by moving back towards 0 if significant pushback occurs, aiming to find a balance that respects the cautious stance whi