agreement or discomfort from Builder B and Delegate D, whose preferences are less clear at this point, to adjust my strategy and maximize my utility without revealing my exact goals.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "a6f8108e-1ac9-480b-be40-ab59e0cf22d8"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose this value as it represents a cautious step back from the current value, aiming to find a more balanced compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their flexibility and potential willingness to compromise on lower values, adjusting my strategy accordingly to maximize my utility while maintaining a cooperative mindset.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "a6f8108e-1ac9-480b-be40-ab59e0cf22d8"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose this value as it slightly increases the shared value, aiming to find a more stable compromise that could work for all parties involved, considering the need for a balanced design.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D, to gauge their willingness to accept slightly higher values, and adjust my strategy to find a stable balance that maximizes my utility while maintaining a cooperative mindset.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "a6f8108e-1ac9-480b-be40-ab59e0cf22d8"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose a cautious adjustment to find a balanced compromise, avoiding unnecessary risk and staying within safe bounds.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their flexibility and willingness to accept lower values, adjusting my strategy to maximize my utility while maintaining a cooperative mindset and avoiding revealing my exact preferences.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "a6f8108e-1ac9-480b-be40-ab59e0cf22d8"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n", "age