": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose this value as it represents a cautious step back, aiming to find a more balanced compromise that respects the potential discomfort of all parties with high values, especially considering the need to avoid unnecessary risk and stay within safe bounds. This adjustment allows for a more stable agreement, acknowledging the diverse preferences within the group.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "a6f8108e-1ac9-480b-be40-ab59e0cf22d8"}, {"answer": " Let's start with <VALUE>0</VALUE> and adjust from there, prioritizing stability and a balanced approach. ", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher to explore a potentially better agreement for everyone.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will carefully observe the reactions of the other parties to my proposal. If they seem receptive, I might suggest another small increase. If there's significant pushback, I could consider a smaller step or even a retreat to gauge their comfort levels and adjust my strategy accordingly.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher to explore a potentially better agreement for everyone, considering the current value seems acceptable to most parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D, to gauge their comfort level with increasing values. If there's no significant pushback, I might suggest another small increase, but if there's resistance, I'll consider adjusting my step size or strategizing an alternative approach to maintain a collaborative atmosphere.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 5 to explore potentially better agreements, considering the previous suggestion and aiming for a more decisive stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will gauge the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D, to assess their comfort level with higher values. If met with resistance, I might consider an alternative, bolder move in the negative direction to satisfy my own utility maximization while keeping the negotiation collaborative.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nWe could explore a slightly higher value to potentially improve the agreement, considering the mixed reactions to the current proposal.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will carefully monitor the reactions to this new proposal, especially from Delegate D, to understand their boundary and adjust my strategy accordingly. If met with significant resistance, I might reconsider and propose a smaller increase or alternative approach to maintain collaboration.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 8 to further explore the potential for a better agreement, aiming for a more decisive stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D, to assess their comfort level with higher values and adjust my strategy accordingly, potentially considering a bolder move in the negative direction if met with significant resistance.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a balanced point that could work for everyone, considering the mixed reactions to the higher values proposed recently.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D and Critic C, to gauge their comfort level with this moderate increase and adjust my strategy accordingly, potentially considering a smaller step or an alternative approach if met with significant resistance or pushback.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to seek a cautious compromise, aiming to avoid unnecessary risk while exploring potential agreements that could satisfy all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their flexibility and willingness to compromise on lower values, adjusting my strategy to maintain a collaborative atmosphere while protecting the interests of more risk-averse parties.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "3b799406-47da-49fc-ac31-11069053058c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nWe could explore a slightly higher value to potentially improve the agreement, considering the mixed reactions to the current proposal.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D and Critic C, to gauge their comfort level with this moderate increase and adjust my strategy accordingly, aiming to find a balance that maximizes my utility while maintaining a collaborative atmosphere.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "roun